OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the first Berkshire-born
OL,4,Aguide dog litter
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first official litter of Guide Dog
OL,7,Fpuppies have been born in the county.
OL,9,FEarlier this year, Guide Dogs extended
OL,10,Fits catchment area towards Reading,
OL,11,Fwhich has allowed people like Clare
OL,12,FThompson, from Wokingham, to sign up to
OL,13,Fbecome what the charity calls a
OL,14,Fbreeding dog holder.
OL,16,FClare, along with her black Labrador
OL,17,FJan, will say good bye to the pups
OL,18,Flater this week as they start training
OL,19,Fto help people with sight loss.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
