OL,5,
OL,6,FThompson, who lives in Wokingham, said:
OL,7,F"It's going to be so sad to see them
OL,8,Fall go. We've got used to their little
OL,9,Fcharacters, they're all individual
OL,10,Flittle puppies now,"
